OPEN SRE DEMO STARTUP

1. Start Kubernetes

sudo podman start opensre-demo-control-plane opensre-demo-worker

kubectl get nodes
kubectl get pods -A


2. Grafana

kubectl port-forward -n observability svc/grafana 3000:80

Open: http://localhost:3000


3. VictoriaMetrics

kubectl port-forward -n observability svc/victoriametrics-victoria-metrics-single-server 8428:8428

Check:
curl http://localhost:8428/-/healthy


4. OpenTelemetry

kubectl port-forward -n observability svc/otel-collector-opentelemetry-collector 4317:4317 4318:4318


5. Backend

cd ~/Projects/opensre-demo/opensre-backend
source .venv/bin/activate
uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8001


6. Frontend

cd ~/Projects/opensre-demo/frontend
npm run dev

Open: http://localhost:5173


DEMO FLOW

Frontend → Select Cluster → Select Namespace → Select Pod
→ Investigate → OpenSRE + Gemini → RCA

Grafana → Show metrics/observability
VictoriaMetrics → Metrics backend
OpenTelemetry → Telemetry collector